        "parms": "# patcher — a subpatch and its inlets and outlets\nA patcher box holds a patch of its own, like Max's p. Its pins are the inlet and outlet objects inside it: .inlet and .outlet for messages, ~inlet and ~outlet for audio. Each takes one argument, its pin number. Unlike Max, where an inlet's place from left to right gives its number and one inlet object carries both, here the argument sets the number, and a ~inlet carries only audio. This subpatch, gain, turns a sine up and down.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
